[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2228.43, "timestamp": "00:37:08", "text": "好的。是的，我们当时处境非常艰难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2231.71, "timestamp": "00:37:11", "text": "对话。嗯，我们当时在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2234.47, "timestamp": "00:37:14", "text": "一场简短的对话。让我看看聊天记录。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2238.63, "timestamp": "00:37:18", "text": "然后我就得到了……嗯……礼物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2242.069, "timestamp": "00:37:22", "text": "我订阅了Zen和我的一些服务，我有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2245.03, "timestamp": "00:37:25", "text": "分心了。哦，是三个礼物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2247.91, "timestamp": "00:37:27", "text": "字幕。非常感谢。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2250.27, "timestamp": "00:37:30", "text": "不必这样，但还是非常感谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2253.67, "timestamp": "00:37:33", "text": "很多。也就是说，你迈出了重要的一步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2255.91, "timestamp": "00:37:35", "text": "这是人自然会来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2257.75, "timestamp": "00:37:37", "text": "戳到痛处了。我不会说强硬。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2260.31, "timestamp": "00:37:40", "text": "向上，但要知道它是一个完整的整体。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2262.43, "timestamp": "00:37:42", "text": "是的。没错，没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2273.89, "timestamp": "00:37:53", "text": "现在我不知道了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2276.03, "timestamp": "00:37:56", "text": "[音乐]"}]